1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,796
It is back in the same state, and internal energy is a state function, so delta U is zero.

2
00:00:06,796 --> 00:00:09,882
The first law then says Q equals W.

3
00:00:09,882 --> 00:00:17,578
The net work is the area enclosed by the loop: work done by the gas on the top, minus the work done on it along the bottom.

